1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,280
Good evening.

2
00:00:02,280 --> 00:00:03,350
King's Restaurant.

3
00:00:03,350 --> 00:00:04,148
Good evening.

4
00:00:04,148 --> 00:00:08,140
I'm ringing about the job I understand you have vacant.

5
00:00:08,140 --> 00:00:09,000
Oh yes.

6
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,730
I'd like to find out a few more details, if I may.

7
00:00:11,730 --> 00:00:12,514
Yes, of course.

8
00:00:12,514 --> 00:00:13,820
Can I take your name?

9
00:00:13,820 --> 00:00:15,710
It's Peter Chin.

10
00:00:15,710 --> 00:00:16,367
Okay Peter.

11
00:00:16,367 --> 00:00:20,967
Well, if you want to ask about the job and then if we're both

12
00:00:20,967 --> 00:00:24,910
still interested, we could arrange for you to come for an interview.

13
00:00:24,910 --> 00:00:25,587
Great, thanks.

14
00:00:25,587 --> 00:00:30,323
I'm afraid I missed the advert for the job but heard about it from

15
00:00:30,323 --> 00:00:31,000
a friend.

16
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:32,223
That's no problem at all.

17
00:00:32,223 --> 00:00:33,690
What would you like to know?

18
00:00:33,690 --> 00:00:37,920
Well, um, what sort of work is it - washing up?

19
00:00:37,920 --> 00:00:40,070
It's answering the phone.

20
00:00:40,070 --> 00:00:42,530
Oh right, fine.

21
00:00:42,530 --> 00:00:44,940
And not waiting at table.

22
00:00:44,940 --> 00:00:46,055
That'd be good.

23
00:00:46,055 --> 00:00:49,400
And how many nights a week would it be?

24
00:00:49,400 --> 00:00:52,500
Well, we're really only busy at the weekend.

25
00:00:52,500 --> 00:00:54,000
So two nights?

26
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:54,653
Three actually,

27
00:00:54,653 --> 00:00:57,920
so it would work out at twelve hours a week.

28
00:00:57,920 --> 00:00:59,040
That'd be fine.

29
00:00:59,040 --> 00:01:01,280
It wouldn't interfere with my studies.

30
00:01:01,280 --> 00:01:02,850
Are you at the university?

31
00:01:02,850 --> 00:01:03,260
Yes.

32
00:01:03,260 --> 00:01:04,900
First year Physics student.

33
00:01:04,900 --> 00:01:06,030
Oh, right.

34
00:01:06,030 --> 00:01:06,416
Um,

35
00:01:06,416 --> 00:01:11,430
and because I'm not an EU national would I need a work permit?

36
00:01:11,430 --> 00:01:12,369
Yes you would.

37
00:01:12,369 --> 00:01:14,560
Just get your tutor to sign it.

38
00:01:14,560 --> 00:01:18,887
That wouldn't be a problem, if I were to get the job.

39
00:01:18,887 --> 00:01:21,050
Um, where exactly is the restaurant?

40
00:01:21,050 --> 00:01:27,000
Well, we have two branches - the one we're recruiting for is in Hillsdunne Road.

41
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:28,588
I don't know that.

42
00:01:28,588 --> 00:01:30,970
How do you spell it please?

43
00:01:30,970 --> 00:01:37,400
It's H-I-double L-S-D-U-double N-E Road.

44
00:01:37,400 --> 00:01:38,478
Got that.

45
00:01:38,478 --> 00:01:39,017
Thanks.

46
00:01:39,017 --> 00:01:42,250
Is it near a bus stop?

47
00:01:42,250 --> 00:01:42,595
Yes.

48
00:01:42,595 --> 00:01:46,050
The nearest one would probably be just beside the Library.

49
00:01:46,050 --> 00:01:47,835
Oh yes, I know it.

50
00:01:47,835 --> 00:01:49,621
That'd be fine for me.

51
00:01:49,621 --> 00:01:52,120
And could I ask about the pay?

52
00:01:52,120 --> 00:01:55,270
We're offering ?4.45 an hour.

53
00:01:55,270 --> 00:01:56,778
That's very good.

54
00:01:56,778 --> 00:02:00,800
My last job was 3.95 an hour.

55
00:02:00,800 --> 00:02:06,090
We feel it's pretty good and we also offer some good fringe benefits.

56
00:02:06,090 --> 00:02:06,850
Really?

57
00:02:06,850 --> 00:02:08,982
Well, we give you a free dinner,

58
00:02:08,982 --> 00:02:10,200
so you eat well.

59
00:02:10,200 --> 00:02:12,660
Right, better than hostel food!

60
00:02:12,660 --> 00:02:14,060
We certainly hope so!

61
00:02:14,060 --> 00:02:17,910
And we also offer extra pay for working on national holidays.

62
00:02:17,910 --> 00:02:18,196
Oh,

63
00:02:18,196 --> 00:02:20,200
that's a really good perk, isn't it?

64
00:02:20,200 --> 00:02:21,477
Yes, we think so.

65
00:02:21,477 --> 00:02:25,945
And then because of the difficulties of getting public transport, if you're working after

66
00:02:25,945 --> 00:02:27,860
11 o'clock we drive you home.

67
00:02:27,860 --> 00:02:28,186
Oh,

68
00:02:28,186 --> 00:02:29,490
that's good to know.

69
00:02:29,490 --> 00:02:34,493
Well, we'd certainly be interested in inviting you for an interview, if you're still

70
00:02:34,493 --> 00:02:34,850
interested?

71
00:02:34,850 --> 00:02:36,239
Oh yes, certainly.

72
00:02:36,239 --> 00:02:40,870
Could I just also ask what qualities you're looking for?

73
00:02:40,870 --> 00:02:45,403
Well, for this particular job we want a clear voice,

74
00:02:45,403 --> 00:02:47,670
which you obviously do have!

75
00:02:47,670 --> 00:02:49,640
Thanks.

76
00:02:49,640 --> 00:02:52,800
And you must be able to think quickly, you know.

77
00:02:52,800 --> 00:02:54,400
Well, I hope I'd…

78
00:02:54,400 --> 00:02:54,745
So,

79
00:02:54,745 --> 00:02:57,505
when could you come in for an interview?

80
00:02:57,505 --> 00:02:59,230
We're actually quite quiet tonight?

81
00:02:59,230 --> 00:03:01,855
Sorry, I couldn't come tonight.

82
00:03:01,855 --> 00:03:07,630
Or tomorrow, I'm afraid.Thursday's okay - that'd be 22nd of October.

83
00:03:07,630 --> 00:03:09,660
Fine, after 5 p.m.?

84
00:03:09,660 --> 00:03:10,569
Yes, fine.

85
00:03:10,569 --> 00:03:12,840
Would 6 o'clock be okay?

86
00:03:12,840 --> 00:03:13,205
Perfect.

87
00:03:13,205 --> 00:03:17,220
And could you bring along with the names of two referees?

88
00:03:17,220 --> 00:03:17,550
Yes,

89
00:03:17,550 --> 00:03:18,870
that's fine, no problem.

90
00:03:18,870 --> 00:03:21,200
Good, I look forward to seeing you.

91
00:03:21,200 --> 00:03:22,676
Oh, by the way,

92
00:03:22,676 --> 00:03:24,520
who should I ask for?

93
00:03:24,520 --> 00:03:26,420
Oh yes, of course, sorry.

94
00:03:26,420 --> 00:03:28,320
My name is Samira Manuja.

95
00:03:28,320 --> 00:03:30,800
Can you spell that, please?

96
00:03:30,800 --> 00:03:34,730
M-A-N-U-J-A.

97
00:03:34,730 --> 00:03:37,136
Okay, I've got that.

98
00:03:37,136 --> 00:03:38,940
Thanks very much.

99
00:03:38,940 --> 00:03:40,940
Look forward to seeing you…
